  {
    "id": "revue",
    "title": {
      "fr": "Revue cinéma",
      "en": "Cinema magazine"
    },
    "category": {
      "fr": "Édition",
      "en": "Editorial design"
    },
    "description": {
      "fr": "Conception de deux numéros d’une revue à collectionner, consacrés à Hannibal et House of the Dragon. Chaque numéro explore la série à travers ses acteurs, sa réalisation, ses thèmes, ses costumes, des entretiens et des critiques.",
      "en": "full design of a cinema magazine that covers one series per number, going into details about the series, the actors, the director, themes , costumes, interviews with the actors and the director, and a review of the series etc... the magazines are designed to be collected and kept as a reference for the series. here you can see the two first numbers, the first one is about the series Hannibal, and the second one is about the series House of the dragon."
    },
